# Routine "Clip queue pass": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Every weekday morning, transcribes any new recording waiting in the clip queue and comes back with the moments worth cutting.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/clip-bot && pi -p "/clip-queue-pass"
